    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_trade_02_00",
      "hash64": "2E2A732D1E5DC0C2",
      "text": "那就用[VAR 0x0100(0000)]的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]和\\n我的溶食兽交换，确定吗～？[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
