    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_battleend_win_01_00",
      "hash64": "88F0E2EE2844B66D",
      "text": "嘻嘻，我输了～\\n你真的很厉害啊～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
