    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "7FEEC80545C9560F",
      "text": "我偶尔也是\\n会努力一把的～\\c\\n如果老师我表现得还不错，\\n那就太好了～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
